INT. USC VANGUARD - COMMAND BRIDGE - 2182

Warning klaxons echo across the battle bridge as enemy cruisers approach from the asteroid belt.

ADMIRAL TERESA CRUZ stands commanding at the center holotank, barked orders ringing across the flight deck!

ADMIRAL TERESA CRUZ
Chief Engineer Vance, divert all auxiliary reactors! I want the Hyperion Dark-Matter Drive fully engaged in three minutes!

Beside Cruz, SPECIAL AGENT GABRIEL CROSS unholsters his pulse pistol, checking the tactical readouts on the central bridge monitor.

SPECIAL AGENT GABRIEL CROSS
Weapons online, Admiral. We will jump out of the system the second the Hyperion Drive spools up in 2182!

ADMIRAL TERESA CRUZ
Engage the jump immediately!
